WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:04.901
Another Thing That Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The SCP Foundation: Dr. Bright is

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:09.680
not allowed to apply SCP-963 to any major
political figures.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.720
Again.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.620
So we’ve got some background here.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:17.360
Anyone who has seen our video on SCP-4444
will know that a species of aliens almost

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.310
destroyed our planet in the year 2000 after
they possessed presidential candidate Al Gore.

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:26.330
In order to stop them, Dr. Bright needed to
take over the body of George W. Bush to run

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.449
against him.

00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:32.009
While this was an emergency where certain
risks needed to be taken, our current geopolitical

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:36.969
landscape is already too wild and too fractious
to risk Dr. Bright ever rising to any kind

00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:38.250
of political power.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.570
Though if he did, he would probably run on
the major campaign slogan “C’mon, Guys,

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.050
You’ve Had Worse!”

